msgstr "Publicar y notificar a los representantes"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.TrustDomain.Propose.bpmn:42
#. Diagram label
msgid "Receive the published Annex"
msgstr "Recibir el anexo publicado"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.TrustDomain.Propose.bpmn:75
#. Diagram label
msgid "Review the proposal"
msgstr "Examinar la propuesta"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.TrustDomain.Propose.bpmn:20
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Sends the Statement of Interest and the Letter of Application; may meet WHO in person (Framework IX). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/BusinessOwnerRepresentative."
msgstr "Envía la Declaración de interés y la Carta de solicitud; puede reunirse con la OMS en persona (Marco IX). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/BusinessOwnerRepresentative."

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.TrustDomain.Propose.bpmn:8
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The Eligible GDHCN Participant (Framework VII)."
msgstr "El Participante cualificado para la Red Mundial (Marco VII)."

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.TrustDomain.Propose.bpmn:87
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The Framework does not say how a proposal that is not approved is answered."
msgstr "El Marco no indica cómo se responde a una propuesta que no se aprueba."

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.TrustDomain.Propose.bpmn:11
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The GDHCN Secretariat at WHO (Framework V, VI)."
msgstr "La Secretaría de la Red Mundial en la OMS (Marco V, VI)."

